{"3834600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "House of Empty Names", "steam_appid": 3834600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a cold floor in an unknown house, missing a kidney, and realize you’ve been kidnapped. Your only goal is to escape at any cost. All within a two-hour playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/2c36a16c7bcf21316132fcda4b74091b.webp?t=1775963585\" width=300 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hears every sound. He hunts, he lures, and he adapts to your actions. He is a thinking intelligent predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/0ccc222c9b9099ea9eb4174d185e89e0.poster.avif?t=1775963585\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/0ccc222c9b9099ea9eb4174d185e89e0.webm?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/0ccc222c9b9099ea9eb4174d185e89e0.mp4?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/4b9d0f79033776f8168332158b643574.webp?t=1775963585\" width=342 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where to go, where to hide, and how to build your path to freedom. Every decision brings you one step closer to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/fc931c5b2cc4cfb8dd60f83d880a5804.poster.avif?t=1775963585\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/fc931c5b2cc4cfb8dd60f83d880a5804.webm?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/fc931c5b2cc4cfb8dd60f83d880a5804.mp4?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/6a9f3a8118a93858686234900d4cf324.webp?t=1775963585\" width=318 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory space and item sizes. Manage your resource, combine items, and choose the right tools to carve your path - inspired by classic survival horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/93dfe0fdbe19451f585822de9b9551d2.poster.avif?t=1775963585\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/93dfe0fdbe19451f585822de9b9551d2.webm?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834600/extras/93dfe0fdbe19451f585822de9b9551d2.mp4?t=1775963585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a cold floor in